---
import ServiceLayout from '../../components/templates/ServiceLayout.astro';
import { serviceBySlug, towns } from '../../lib/business';

const service = serviceBySlug('custom-software')!;
const townLinks = towns.map((t) => ({ href: `/web-design-${t.slug}`, label: `${t.name}, OR`, sub: t.county }));
---

<ServiceLayout
  service={service}
  title="Custom Software & SaaS Development · Winters Code"
  description="Custom software and SaaS for Oregon coast businesses. Portals, dashboards, and multi-tenant systems built for the work off-the-shelf tools cannot handle."
  eyebrow="Services · Custom Software"
  h1="Software shaped to how you actually work."
  sub="Portals, dashboards, and systems built for the parts of your business no off-the-shelf tool covers."
  sub2="When the spreadsheet finally breaks."
  bgImage="/photo/local/estuary-grass"
  showcase
  heroFocal="center 40%"
  intro={[
    "Most businesses outgrow their tools the same way: a spreadsheet becomes the system of record, then three spreadsheets, then a tangle of apps that do not talk to each other and a person whose real job is copying data between them.",
    "Custom software replaces that tangle with one system built around your actual workflow. Not a generic platform you bend your business to fit, but <span class='hl-green'>software that fits the business you already run.</span>",
  ]}
  includes={[
    { h: 'Internal dashboards', body: 'One screen that shows the state of the business: jobs, inventory, bookings, revenue. The numbers you keep rebuilding by hand.' },
    { h: 'Customer portals', body: 'A secure place for your clients to log in, see their account, pay, and self-serve the requests that fill your inbox.' },
    { h: 'Multi-tenant systems', body: 'Multiple roles, locations, or client organizations under one roof, with the right walls between them.' },
    { h: 'Workflow automation', body: 'The repetitive steps, intake, routing, follow-up, reminders, handled by the software instead of by you.' },
    { h: 'Integrations', body: 'Stripe, QuickBooks, your CRM, your booking tool, wired together so data flows once and stays in sync.' },
    { h: 'Real ownership', body: 'Your software, your data, documented and handed over. No per-seat fees climbing forever as you grow.' },
  ]}
  sections={[
    {
      heading: 'I build my own software too',
      body: [
        'This is not a service I picked up to fill a menu. I run my own products on custom software: <strong>Baseline</strong>, a multi-model intelligence dashboard, and <strong>Demiurge</strong>, a memory engine holding more than <span class="stat">2,500</span> records that powers everything I build.',
        'So when I build a portal or a dashboard for your business, it is the same engineering I trust to run mine. <em>Built by hand, secure by default, maintained by the person who wrote it.</em>',
      ],
    },
  ]}
  whyLink
  faq={[
    { q: 'How do I know if I need custom software?', a: 'A good sign is when spreadsheets have become the system that runs the business, or when someone spends real hours moving data between apps that should talk to each other. If a tool would save those hours, it usually pays for itself.' },
    { q: 'Is this not too expensive for a small business?', a: 'It does not have to be. I scope to the one workflow that hurts most and build that first, so you get value fast instead of a giant project. Then we grow it only if the return is there.' },
    { q: 'Can it connect to the tools I already use?', a: 'Yes. Integration is most of the point. Stripe, QuickBooks, your CRM, your booking system, connected so data flows once and stays correct everywhere.' },
    { q: 'Do I own it, or am I renting again?', a: 'You own it. The code and the data are yours, documented and handed over. No per-seat subscription that grows every time you hire.' },
  ]}
  relatedTitle="Custom software across Coos and Curry counties"
  relatedIntro="Local pages for the towns I serve."
  relatedLinks={townLinks}
/>
